282521-character-sheets?p=1284108#post1284108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quick question as I only checked the ones in the book. Are the attributes from the original maxed at 5 as in Yue Ryong files or maxed at 6 as in the books?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The ones that came bundled on drivethrough have 5 dots.<br /> <br /> I think I get the reason. Putting six dots on the sheet could give too easy an impression you can raise the stat that heigh normally (when it in fact takes a purchased Talents-only Edge).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 02-02-2019, 10:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-02T06:35:25-08:00","id":1284328,"title":"","content":"I wonder if the the final sheets (when Health gets replaced with something) will have &quot;Momentum&quot; like the Scion ones. Seems like a waste of space on the characters sheet to me since it's not a personal pool. It should be a thing you pile in the middle of the table for everyone to see. It shouldn't be a thing that everyone screws up trying to track on their individual character sheets because everyone forgets to modify it not their sheet when somebody else spends it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_li